note contract 6 lines 169-170 and erratum E2: unsized `view uchar *` parameters receive sized arrays of
note length 10 and 3; `len v` is the run-time length. stdout 10, 315, 3, 15 (exp/v6-sum.out, python3).
om2
fn vsum v view uchar * to ulong
x = ulong 0
for i ulong len v
x = add x ulong get v i
end
ret x
end
fn plen v view uchar * to ulong
ret len v
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 0
for i ulong 10
put a i uchar mul i 7
end
b = new uchar 3 5
putd plen a
putd vsum a
putd plen b
putd vsum b
ret 0
end
